  "body": "** You are welcome to use the driveway to access the property - there is plenty of space to turn around for your convenience **\r\n\r\nAfter 51 years in the family, my vendors have made the tough decision to sell. They are ready to let another family enjoy this property as much as they have and start making memories for years to come.\r\n\r\nPositioned on a generous 1,239 m² (more or less) section framed by mature New Zealand native trees, this exceptional property offers the ultimate blend of coastal serenity, space, and potential. Tucked away in a tranquil setting, the home is a vibrant haven for local birdlife while boasting wide, elevated vistas over Shakespear Regional Park and Okoromai Bay.\r\n\r\nWhether you are looking for a comfortable coastal move-in or searching for a home with incredible upside, this property is perfect for someone wanting to re-decorate and add their own personal touch to create their dream living space.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n• Spacious Living: Thoughtfully laid out with two comfortable bedrooms (possibly three) and two bathrooms. The heart of the home features a light-filled open-plan kitchen and family area alongside a combined formal living and dining room.\r\n\r\n• Versatile Space: A remarkably spacious this rumpus offers endless options, ideal for a home office, secondary lounge, entertainment zone or teenager’s den. This is complemented by a double garage with internal access.\r\n\r\n• Outdoor Oasis: Wrap-around decking on three sides provides the ultimate stage for alfresco dining and entertaining while taking in sweeping views of the bay and parklands.\r\n\r\n• Add Value & Personal Style: A wonderful canvas ready for your creative interior updates and styling choices.\r\n\r\n• Prime Location: Enjoy short, scenic strolls to local beaches, parks, and public transport options.\r\n\r\nConveniently located just a short drive from Whangaparaoa Golf Course, local schools, and the vibrant Gulf Harbour Village with its selection of cafes, restaurants, and shops. Commuters will appreciate the quick drive to Gulf Harbour Marina for direct ferry services into Auckland CBD.\r\n\r\nCall me today to view this gem. Don’t wait another 51 years to see it on the market again.",
